# shell: desktop
# DB-048/DB-049/DB-051: the bar can be moved to another edge by dragging it
# with Ctrl held, and where it ends up is remembered.
note the bar starts docked right
expect-deskbar-at 866 0
note Ctrl-dragging it to the top edge re-docks it
press 900 120 1 ctrl
move 500 200
move 500 3
release 500 3
wait 5
expect-deskbar-at 0 0
note and a Ctrl-drag that ends in the MIDDLE leaves it where it is
press 500 3 1 ctrl
move 500 300
release 500 300
wait 5
expect-deskbar-at 0 0
quit
